Matam Ghame shabbir Me Aelaane wafa Hai<br>
yeh Mit Nahi Sakta Hai Yeh Zehra Ki Dua Mai<br>
<br>
1. Zehra Ke Gulistaa'n Ko Loota Gaya Ban Me<br>
<br>
pamaal Huva Qasim-e-naushah Bhi Ran Me<br>
<br>
aur Qaima-e-shabbir Me Kohraam Bapa Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Zainab Ne Kaha Peet Ke Sar Haye Re Ghurbath<br>
<br>
ab Koun Karega Meri Chadar Ki Hifazath<br>
<br>
darya Pe Alamdar-e-jari Qatl Huva Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Farmati Thi Rokar Yehi Bas Zainab-e-nashaad<br>
<br>
kis Tarha Badhau'n Mai Qadam Sayyad-e-sajjad<br>
<br>
har Simt Tamashayi Hai Sar Mera Khula Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Q1smath Se Mila Jo Hamein Shabbir Ka Hai Gham<br>
<br>
yeh Jeete Ji Hoga Na Kabhi Zindagi Me Kam<br>
<br>
har Lamha Hamein Fatima Zehra Ki Dua Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Kin Ankhou'n Se Shashmahe Ko Dekhegi Woh Mad<br>
<br>
marjaye Na Sadme Se Kahin Bano-e-muztar<br>
<br>
nanha Sa Gal Zulm Ke Nawak Se Chida Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Jakda Huva Zanjeerou'n Me Hai Abid-e-muztar<br>
<br>
kis Tarha Se Dafnaye Bhala Lasha-e-khwahar<br>
<br>
ek Bhai Pe Zinda'n Me Ajab Waqt Pada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Jo Ran Me Luti Hai Usi Jaageer Ka Matam<br>
<br>
karte Raho Har Haal Me Shabbir Ka Matam<br>
<br>
majlis Yeh Najaf Hazrat-e-zainab Ki Ataa Hai